<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-17T05:46:37.107Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:46:37 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Nigeria have recently foiled a terrorist attack in Riyom using drone and CCTV surveillance, while a nurse died after an asthma attack at a federal hospital amid allegations of emergency care failures. Gunmen continue abducting Catholic priests in Benue, including Rev. Fr. John Otache, and have seized a married couple and their six-month-old daughter in Kaduna before releasing them for ransom. In Plateau, a traditional ruler was killed, and in Zamfara gunmen blocked a road, vandalising vehicles before troops rescued a farmer. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDc5aGstcVFvYWxpRlczSEVzOUtWWUxOY3hTWGZZTlBPZDRYcV8zMEJEVDM2cGJlUkc3YmNiYkFJdVFhdzNHUVBIOS1rbmkyUjZOTWo2Y2lhUVNJMUxDd0hUNmtTb3A1S3NOdTB0RHJXcGxiRUd4aU5lU3daUkdUeEx5bE42di0wYzJLMndsbVFwVjVTN21HdVZkOHplRi01bkVIN1BrMkJMSFozX250eWtB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPcFZtNFNEN2JfMWRJaVE3RTFYY21mdlFtYmNSM2pWRkdpRU5COVZ0Q2lFT3ZHUXRQd2tYU2o2b0VYMjFiRXBtZWhiU2cyZThLQ0kzVW1DNHFoNWlLNkZFMEs1TzVaQ1hfLUFJMENBa3VvVmxDTzZxSFA2QmhSV24weVZYWDhSQnc1Tmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNUkNiQll5TXg5NzBaTkQyVUVHWkk2aXdsOURtNlNOM1RiRVV6YXRZaVd2OXRmUkREb1FKNWZMei1lZzV4enZ5VTZmcHNrTF9BSVFjU2E0b2NESFRsc1d4eVhwaUt5QkswYkNVNm16VXowdVl0ekZaTy0zY0xBeGJGeDkxRDZGV25f?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQbktVVzc1T0hnOXdfNERfVFRCT0N6QWRNRXNNcjJ6bENuUm1Pek9welJUSU5GakszLThUdFhJeW5UZ0xjWXk2VXI2MlVrT0pZZXRubVpCNDZsbUwwdUpnakxyc0FzOC1fSUZDa0J1RUF3MmZoQXFIVTRmMDk1M1dVQ2N3SDBYcEQyY2xZX1dreWZIZzhnRW1DRm9vLXk3VkoteGNOWE1OYWts